[[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in OFF\nposition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428180\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428928\">1056B82</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the injection/ignition control\nunit mounting (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043984.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in OFF\nposition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428180\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428928\">1056B82</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the injection/ignition control\nunit mounting (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2043984.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the injection - ignition control\nunit mounting back in its housing and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428928\">1056B82</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"],[4,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the injection - ignition control\nunit mounting back in its housing and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2428928\">1056B82</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p>"]]